  "content": {
    "blocks": [
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "body": {
          "en": "Mechanics begins with motion in a straight line under constant acceleration.",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "thm",
        "label": {
          "en": "▲ Reference — suvat equations",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "For constant acceleration: \\( v=u+at \\), \\( s=ut+\\tfrac12 at^{2} \\), \\( v^{2}=u^{2}+2as \\). Velocity is the derivative of displacement; acceleration the derivative of velocity.",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "cards",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Velocity",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( v=u+at \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Displacement",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( ut+\\tfrac12at^{2} \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "No time",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( v^{2}=u^{2}+2as \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Acceleration",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( \\tfrac{dv}{dt} \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example 11.A",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>With \\( u=0 \\), \\( a=2 \\), \\( t=3 \\), find \\( v \\).</p>\\[ v=0+2(3)=6. \\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example — Calculus kinematics",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>A particle moves so that its velocity at time \\(t\\) s is \\(v=3t^2-12t+9\\) m/s. Find (a) the acceleration at \\(t=2\\), (b) when the particle is momentarily at rest.</p><p>(a) \\(a=\\dfrac{dv}{dt}=6t-12\\). At \\(t=2\\): \\(a=0\\) m/s².</p><p>(b) \\(v=0\\Rightarrow3(t-1)(t-3)=0\\Rightarrow t=1\\) s or \\(t=3\\) s.</p>",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "practiceProblem",
        "question": {
          "en": "A car decelerates uniformly from 25 m/s to rest in 10 s. Find (a) the deceleration, (b) the distance travelled.",
          "ar": null
        },
        "solution": {
          "en": "SUVAT: \\(u=25\\), \\(v=0\\), \\(t=10\\). (a) \\(a=\\tfrac{v-u}{t}=\\tfrac{-25}{10}=-2.5\\) m/s². (b) \\(s=\\tfrac{u+v}{2}t=\\tfrac{25}{2}\\times10=125\\) m.",
          "ar": null
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "quizWidget": {
    "enabled": true
  }
}
